OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786634313
OL,3,CSecond World War veterans with
OL,4,Ccombined age of 300 take off in
OL,5,CSpitfires
OL,7,FSecond World War veterans with a
OL,8,Fcombined aged of 300 years have taken
OL,9,Foff in Spitfire planes above Kent.
OL,11,FFamily and fellow veterans watched as
OL,12,Fthe three ex-servicemen from the
OL,13,FKing's Royal Rifle Corps, the South
OL,14,FStaffordshire Regiment and the
OL,15,FHighland Light Infantry boarded their
OL,16,Fflights from Biggin Hill on Thursday
OL,17,Fmorning.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
