OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786634313
OL,3,CSecond World War veterans with
OL,4,Ccombined age of 300 take off in
OL,5,CSpitfires
OL,7,FThe journeys were paid for by a
OL,8,Fcharity run by black cab drivers that
OL,9,Forganises activities for ex-military
OL,10,Fpersonnel.
OL,12,FSouth Staffordshire Regiment's Ivan
OL,13,FStaines, 99, was photographed wearing
OL,14,Fhis medals as he played with his great-
OL,15,Fgrandson Alfie Rose, five, in the
OL,16,Fhangar.
OL,18,FMr Staines served in the Home Guard
OL,19,Ffrom 1942 to 1944, when he was called
OL,20,Fup to fight in mainland Europe aged 18.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38203
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786634313
OL,3,CSecond World War veterans with
OL,4,Ccombined age of 300 take off in
OL,5,CSpitfires
OL,7,FHe was transferred to the South
OL,8,FStaffordshire Regiment and later
OL,9,Fdeployed to Palestine.
OL,11,FMeanwhile, the daughter of Alfred
OL,12,FCooley, 100, said her father was
OL,13,Ffulfilling his wish by flying in the
OL,14,Fplane.
OL,16,FMr Cooley signed up to the Highland
OL,17,FLight Infantry's 5th Battalion the day
OL,18,Fbefore D-Day.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38204
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786634313
OL,3,CSecond World War veterans with
OL,4,Ccombined age of 300 take off in
OL,5,CSpitfires
OL,7,FAfter eight weeks' training, aged 18,
OL,8,Fhe landed in a liberated France and
OL,9,Ftravelled towards the German border
OL,10,Fthrough Belgium and the Netherlands.
OL,12,FIn a statement through organisers, his
OL,13,Fdaughter Ann Crossley said: "Today is
OL,14,Fthe day my wonderful dad gets to
OL,15,Ffulfil his wish to fly in a Spitfire
OL,16,Fcourtesy of the Taxi Charity For
OL,17,FMilitary Veterans.
OL,26,@uD@]OU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38205
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786634313
OL,3,CSecond World War veterans with
OL,4,Ccombined age of 300 take off in
OL,5,CSpitfires
OL,7,F"We are so grateful for all the things
OL,8,Fthey have done for dad, the places he
OL,9,Fhas seen and the camaraderie he has
OL,10,Fexperienced.
OL,12,F"He has so many new friends in this
OL,13,Ffantastic 'family' and is loving every
OL,14,Fminute of it."
OL,16,FThey were joined by the King's Royal
OL,17,FRifle Corps' Paul Terry, 101, who was
OL,18,Fone of three brothers who all survived
OL,19,Fthe war.
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@AOUvD@NO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/6
