OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,383,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38206
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1786634313
OL,3,CSecond World War veterans with
OL,4,Ccombined age of 300 take off in
OL,5,CSpitfires
OL,7,FMr Terry landed in Normandy the day
OL,8,Fafter D-Day and travelled through
OL,9,FFrance, Belgium and Holland.
OL,11,FHe fought in operation Market Garden
OL,12,Fto secure Nijmegen Bridge and then
OL,13,Fmoved on to Arnhem.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/6
